abstract: An R data package providing comprehensive access to the UN-Water Global
  Analysis and Assessment of Sanitation and Drinking-water (GLAAS) dataset. The WHO
  GLAAS survey collects data on water, sanitation, and hygiene (WASH) systems, policies,
  and financing from countries worldwide.
